# Raw-text catalog

Follow [docs/RAW_TEXT_PIPELINE.md](../../docs/RAW_TEXT_PIPELINE.md).

- Persist lemma **titles** in `wordlist_titles` before bulk extract.
- Catalog API/CLI returns **plain text** fields from `WiktionaryEntry`; do not add HTML to catalog responses.
- MDX/HTML export stays in `src/mdict/` only.
